<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to Feb 24 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     491	   21,298	4,980</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  7		452	  156</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0	    1,057	  207</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		410     23,915</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		121	   20</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0		835	  287</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  1		 45	    8</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    174	    4,548	  693</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
